            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>New guidelines on disease management of drug hypersensitivity have been released by the American College of Allergy, Asthma, &amp; Immunology. The guidelines deal extensively with preventing adverse drug reactions, which represent a major source of unnecessary expense for hospitals and health plans.</AbstractText>
